important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " The First Conditional", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use the First Conditional to talk about real possibilities in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the First Conditional to talk about something that has a real possibility of happening in the future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If</span> clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Clause\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you choose the robotic system </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> it will increase the chance of a successful operation</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If they have the procedure,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">they may develop serious complications following it. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": " I have been offered an opening for the removal of my cancerous prostate if I opt for a robotic surgical system. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " What are my chances of recovery if I go ahead with it?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I understand correctly, you are more worried about a robotic surgeon than by the surgery itself.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Modal Verbs in the Passive Voice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use modal verbs to add meaning to other verbs.  They come before the dictionary form (infinitive without <span class=\"italic\">to</span>) of the main verb. <br/>Modal verbs add meaning to show certainty or obligation in a sentence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use modal verbs in the passive voice. <br/>You use the passive voice when you want to focus on the \"receiver\" of the action, rather than the \"doer\" of the action. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here is the structure of a passive sentence:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + To be + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">How safely <span class=\"strong\">is</span> the procedure <span class=\"strong\">done</span> with a robot at the helm? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can add a modal verb before the To be.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Subject + modal + To be + past participle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">How safely <span class=\"strong\">can</span> the procedure <span class=\"strong\"> be done</span> with a robot at the helm? </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Here the sentence now has an additional meaning of possibility, thanks to the modal <span class=\"strong\">can</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The surgery could not be performed unless I embarked on a weight loss program immediately. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The operation cannot be considered anything but essential.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It can be reached only with difficulty in overweight patients.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Your recovery rate could even be higher than for a patient who is not overweight. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to seek ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to go in search or quest of", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I want to seek a second opinion", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about robotic surgeons.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "helm", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in charge or in the position of a leader", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: How safely can the procedure be done with a robot at the helm?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to cut open", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to dissect", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The idea of being cut open and operated on by a robot frightens me.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "removal", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the act of taking somebody/something away from a particular place", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have been offered an opening for the removal of my cancerous prostate. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "procedure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a set of steps for getting something done", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If they have the procedure, they may develop serious complications following it. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pelvis", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the large circular bones that support the lower part of your back and are connected to the bones of your legs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The prostate is located deep within the pelvis.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "within", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in or into the interior or inner part; inside", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Within the body is the skeleton.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "overweight", "type": "name"}, {"content": "too heavy", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your recovery rate could even be higher than for a patient who is not overweight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "complication", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a difficulty or problem", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Unfortunately, there were several unexpected complications.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le15ob09aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": " Go online or to a library and look up robots used in medicine.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make notes on what you find out. Try to find 2 or 3 examples.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a short summary on each of the robots and read it to a partner in class. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's summaries.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss the uses of robots in medicine and what you think about it.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I find out about robots used in medicine. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write up summaries on my findings.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my summaries with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give my thoughts on using robots in medicine.", "type": "text"}]}], "