e...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le15ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le15ob09re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le15ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn8le15ob09re2img01.jpg", "text": "Dear Dr. Brook,\n<br/><br/>\nI was recently diagnosed with prostate cancer. Because I am about 65 pounds overweight, I was told that the surgery could not be performed unless I embarked on a weight loss program immediately. I sought a second opinion. Now, I have been offered an opening for the removal of my\ncancerous prostate if I opt for a robotic surgical system. <br/>\nAlthough the operation cannot be considered anything but essential, the idea of being cut open and operated on by a robot frightens me. How safely can the procedure be done with a robot at the helm?  What are my chances of recovery if I go ahead with it?<br/><br/>\nPetrified with Prostate Cancer\n<br/><br/>\n...", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le15ob09re2img03.jpg", "text": "Dear Petrified, <br/><br/>\nIf I understand correctly, you are more worried about a robotic surgeon than by the surgery itself. Let me reassure you: the use of a robotic system in prostate surgery is a miraculous achievement in medical science. The prostate is located deep within the pelvis, so it can be reached only with difficulty in overweight patients. If they have the procedure, they may develop serious complications following it. <br/>", "time": "47000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le15ob09re2img03.jpg", "text": "If you choose the robotic system it will increase the chance of a successful operation while decreasing the chance of complications. Your recovery rate could even be higher than a patient who is not overweight. <br/><br/>\nGood luck, <br/><br/>Doctor Brook", "time": "79000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "text", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "Dear Dr. Harrison,<br/><br/>\nMy name is Anna . When I was 45 years old I was diagnosed with breast cancer. I had a breast conserving surgery. Now I am 47 years old and I am supposed to undergo radiation therapy. I suppose I'll have to do it because  the cancer is spreading. I wonder  if you may give me advice regarding the right procedure. Is it really necessary to undergo radiation therapy or should I seek a second option? I have heard great things about the robotic surgical system. Is this type of procedure  common in my case?\n"}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}